WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Claude, Codex, OpenCode, and OpenClaw join a fictional release task.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.500
One Hermes Agent joins to research the release.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Codex waits for GitHub CI. Its companion begins orbiting.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:20.500
Checks run while the other agents continue their work.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.500
Checks pass. The CI wait clears and its companion leaves.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.500
Claude now needs permission—a separate kind of waiting.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.000
After simulated approval in the source terminal, work resumes.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The fictional task finishes. All five agents settle.
